Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.46,0:00:37.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(北韩 北川海岸)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.00,0:02:58.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 这是怎么回事? 我应该要...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, what is this? I'm supposed to...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.61,0:03:47.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孟谭尚上校总部 北韩非军事区域\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colonel Tan-Sun Moon's H.Q. De-Militarised Zone North Korea
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.43,0:03:58.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打开袋子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.40,0:04:05.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看你还敢不敢训我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That will teach you to lecture me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.45,0:04:19.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芝麻开门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Retract the blast doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.76,0:04:27.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找个新的心理辅导医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find me a new anger therapist.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.13,0:04:39.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(传送中)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.82,0:04:52.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是赵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Zao.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.92,0:04:54.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你迟到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are late.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.62,0:04:59.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,范彼克先生 久违了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Van Bierk. I've been looking forward to this meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.12,0:05:02.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.43,0:05:06.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孟上校 我非洲的军事伙伴 让我转达他的谢意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My African military friends owe you many thanks, Colonel Moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.00,0:05:10.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,联合国禁运后 没几个够胆交易叛军钻石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Few men have the guts to trade conflict diamonds since the U.N. embargo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.94,0:05:14.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,联合国的事我还略知一二 我在哈佛和牛津读过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know all about the U.N. I studied at Oxford and Harvard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.17,0:05:18.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主修西方伪善\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Majored in Western hypocrisy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.11,0:05:22.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从你收藏的车子来看 我可不这么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From your modest collection of cars, I wouldn't have guessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.55,0:05:26.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要看钻石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show me the diamonds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.45,0:05:29.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要看武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show me the weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.32,0:05:34.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring the weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.87,0:05:49.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在非军事区域藏匿武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hiding weapons in the de-militarised zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.97,0:05:54.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这儿地雷可不少 - 多亏了美国鬼子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's a bit of a minefield out there. - America's cultural contribution.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.91,0:05:59.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算再多地雷 我的气垫船都可在上面漂过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One million landmines. And my hovercrafts float right over them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.83,0:06:18.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,RPG 火焰喷射器 自动武器...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}RPGs, flamethrowers, automatic weapons...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.54,0:06:21.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,数不尽的弹药 足够发动一场小战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and enough ammunition to run a small war.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.61,0:06:23.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的钻石呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My diamonds?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.31,0:06:28.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上检查一遍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check it over quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.59,0:06:38.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,省着点花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't blow it all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.46,0:06:42.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一批货我有特别用途\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have special plans for this consignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.24,0:07:00.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他叫詹姆斯邦德 英国杀手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His name is James Bond, a British assassin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.52,0:07:14.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,范彼克先生 给你看一样东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Van Bierk, let me show you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.20,0:07:19.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的最新坦克克星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our new tank buster.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.13,0:07:22.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,衰变铀炮弹 不二之选\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Depleted uranium shells, naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.10,0:07:24.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.88,0:07:41.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看你怎么杀的了我 邦德先生?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And how do you propose to kill me now, Mr. Bond?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.72,0:07:52.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可悲啊 你们英国人还以为 可以对别人指手划脚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's pathetic that you British still beliee you have the right to police the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.96,0:07:56.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就快要死了 而北韩就快要统一全韩了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will not live to see the day all Korea is ruled by the North.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.87,0:07:59.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你总算说到点子上去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you and I have something in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.97,0:08:02.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.01,0:08:03.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我儿子在那里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's my son?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.61,0:08:05.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是将军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the General.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.78,0:08:09.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello... Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.85,0:08:10.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么有火光?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is there a fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.91,0:08:12.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我五分钟后就到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be there in five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.99,0:08:17.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把武器撤走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the weapons out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.35,0:08:18.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀了间谍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and kill the spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.90,0:12:32.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿弥陀佛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Saved by the bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.26,0:12:56.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想不到是白发人送黑发人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My son is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.14,0:13:44.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《007系列之择日而亡》
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.06,0:16:50.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,14个月之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}14 months later
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.48,0:17:12.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来你吃了不少苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't condone what they do here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.98,0:17:16.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这事你得问她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell it to the concierge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.60,0:17:30.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亏你还笑的出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still you jest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.43,0:17:33.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死到临头还那么狂妄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Defiant to the last.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.60,0:17:36.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们抛弃了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your people have abandoned you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.77,0:17:41.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当你不存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your very existence denied.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.11,0:17:45.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你却守口如瓶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why stay silent?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.45,0:17:50.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无所谓了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't matter anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.12,0:17:53.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经管不了了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Things are out of my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.76,0:18:36.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到地头了 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We reach the end, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.03,0:18:38.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你省省吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spare me the unpleasantries.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.04,0:18:46.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超级强权把韩国一分为二 五十年后...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fifty years after the superpowers carved Korea in two...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.91,0:18:49.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你出现在北韩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and then you arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.54,0:18:52.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以英国间谍 杀手的身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A British spy, an assassin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.38,0:18:58.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,落了个话柄给强硬派\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now the hard-liners have their proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.22,0:19:01.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不能相信西方人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We cannot trust the West.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.22,0:19:04.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.99,0:19:08.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你夺走了我儿子的性命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You took away my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.03,0:19:12.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他早就该打靶了 我代劳而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your firing squad should have done the job for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.51,0:19:21.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本希望西方教育 能让他成为...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hoped a Western education would help him become a bridge...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.11,0:19:24.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两个世界的桥梁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...between our worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.51,0:19:28.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想不到却腐化了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But all it did was to corrupt him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.92,0:19:31.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过去的就让它过去 好不好?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get this over with, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.52,0:19:35.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我儿子在西方有同党\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My son had an ally in the West.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.59,0:19:40.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后一次问你 是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the last time, who was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.76,0:19:43.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁让他背叛了国家 和他自己的姓氏?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who made him betray his country and name?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.37,0:19:47.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他也背叛了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The same person who betrayed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.04,0:19:52.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,转过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.05,0:20:02.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向前走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Start walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.64,0:20:28.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请继续走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep walking, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.61,0:20:30.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.32,0:20:46.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zao.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.16,0:20:49.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我被用来交换的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm being traded...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.40,0:20:53.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.00,0:20:56.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续走 请继续走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep moving. Keep walking, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.77,0:20:58.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你总有玩完的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your time will come.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.87,0:21:01.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咱们走着瞧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not as soon as yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.71,0:21:06.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请继续走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep walking, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.62,0:21:20.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看他那熊样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.79,0:21:21.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再次检查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Double check.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.06,0:21:24.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还当他是英雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd think he was some kind of a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.90,0:21:27.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 9号参考资料 帮我查查 - 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Reference nine. - Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.07,0:21:35.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第四区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Section four.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.61,0:21:38.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 抓紧他 抓住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, hold him tight. Got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.41,0:21:41.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心他的腿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch his legs now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.98,0:21:43.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.09,0:21:54.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初步检查没发现生化物质 他很干净\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No biological agents in the prelim scan. He's clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.96,0:21:57.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脉搏72 血压120/80\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pulse, 72. Blood pressure, 120/80.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.26,0:22:03.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有神经毒 组织胺 复合胺 酵素抑制剂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indications of neurotoxins, histamine, serotonin and enzyme inhibitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.50,0:22:05.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蝎子毒液\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scorpion venom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.37,0:22:07.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但有也抗毒血清的痕迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Note also traces of a venom antiserum.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.04,0:22:10.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们先让蝎子蛰他 再为他解毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'd sting him then administer the antidote.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.54,0:22:13.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他的内脏没有受到影响\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yet his internal organs seem unaffected.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.71,0:22:16.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肝的状况不太好 但的确是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Liver not too good. It's definitely him then.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.39,0:22:24.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.64,0:22:38.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.15,0:22:50.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们真客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Such hospitality.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.49,0:23:02.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好像不是很高兴看到我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't seem too pleased to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.93,0:23:06.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果照我的方式 你现在还在朝鲜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I'd had my way, you'd still be in North Korea.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.50,0:23:11.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把你赎回来花了我们不少代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your freedom came at too high a price.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.44,0:23:14.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zao.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.04,0:23:17.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他差点炸了 中国和南韩的高峰会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He tried to blow up a summit between South Korea and China.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.04,0:23:21.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死了三个中国特工才抓到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Took out three Chinese agents before he was caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.05,0:23:23.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在他自由了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now he's free.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.88,0:23:28.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从没要求赎我出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never asked to be traded.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.62,0:23:30.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我情愿死也不想他被放出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd rather die than let him loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.22,0:23:34.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你有那个药的 - 老早就丢了 这怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You had cyanide. - Threw it away years ago. What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.36,0:23:36.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美国在北韩的高级情报员...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The top American agent...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.13,0:23:41.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一周前被处决了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in the North Korean High Command was executed a week ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.26,0:23:44.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美国人从你的监狱里 截听到指证他的讯息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Americans intercepted a signal from your prison naming him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.04,0:23:47.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他们认为是我?  - 就你关在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And they think it's me? - You were the only inmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.64,0:23:52.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们认为你吃不了苦头 已经动摇了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They concluded you cracked and were hemorrhaging information.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.64,0:23:54.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须救你出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had to get you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.91,0:24:01.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你又是怎么想的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.13,0:24:13.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从你身上残留的药物分析来看 你根本就不知道说过什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With the drugs they gave you, you wouldn't know what you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.80,0:24:15.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道规则\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.10,0:24:17.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一条就是 无情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And number one is, no deals.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.03,0:24:21.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被抓了就是被遗弃了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get caught and you're given up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.54,0:24:24.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那次任务出了问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mission was compromised.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.84,0:24:27.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孟上校接到线报认出了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moon got a call exposing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.64,0:24:30.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连他爸都知道 他在西方有同党\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had a partner in the West. Even his father knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.11,0:24:35.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不管是真是假 都没有关系 - 不 有关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Whether that's true or not, it's irrelevant. - No, it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.29,0:24:40.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陷害我的人 再度设计用我来赎出赵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The same person who set me up then set me up to get Zao out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.22,0:24:41.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定要逮到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I'm going after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.12,0:24:45.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你先去福克兰的评估中心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to our evaluation center in the Falklands.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.89,0:24:47.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的情报员资格已经取消了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Double-O status rescinded.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.06,0:24:49.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我的自由是不是也?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Along with my freedom?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.00,0:24:53.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看你的表现再做定夺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For as long as I deem necessary, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.97,0:24:57.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在是闲人一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're no use to anyone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.97,0:25:29.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(心跳)
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.57,0:26:01.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(心脏监视器)
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.60,0:26:02.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(心跳遂停)
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.74,0:26:10.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他心跳停了 - 拿急救器 通知他的上司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's in cardiac arrest. - Get the crash cart. Notify his superiors.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.48,0:26:14.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 心电图没有显示了 - 准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's flat-lining on the ECG. - Stand by.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.68,0:26:16.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,200焦耳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two hundred joules.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.15,0:26:19.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,300焦耳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three hundred.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.52,0:26:23.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再一些阿托品 我们失去他了! 准备心脏起搏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me some atropine. We're losing him! Stand by. Clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.83,0:26:33.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要出院了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm checking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.10,0:26:38.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你的救命香吻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for the kiss of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.71,0:26:45.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三楼出现安全漏洞 所有人员 红色警戒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Security breach on level three. All personnel, defensive code red.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.45,0:26:47.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使用武力捉拿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apprehend and detain with force.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.05,0:26:52.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三楼出现安全漏洞 所有人员 红色警戒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Security breach on level three. All personnel, defensive code red.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.42,0:26:54.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使用武力捉拿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apprehend and detain with force.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.62,0:26:58.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三楼出现安全漏洞 所有人员 红色警戒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Security breach on level three. All personnel, defensive code red.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.42,0:27:28.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(香港游艇俱乐部)
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.84,0:27:44.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天 什么人啊这是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My goodness, standards are falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.71,0:27:47.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,领带都不打\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No tie, dear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.11,0:27:51.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,套房 跟上次一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My usual suite, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.72,0:27:55.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有信用卡吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have a credit card?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.08,0:27:58.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有行李吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or even any luggage, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.95,0:28:00.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邦德先生 真高兴见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Bond, so good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.06,0:28:03.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好久不见 - 陈先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's been a long time. - Mr. Chang.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.63,0:28:05.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总统套房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open the Presidential Suite.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.13,0:28:08.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请我的裁缝过来 顺便带点吃的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send up my tailor. And some food.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.90,0:28:13.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天的龙虾不错 伴有鹌鹑蛋和海带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The lobster's good, with quails' eggs and sliced seaweed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.57,0:28:17.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 看看还有没有61年的波林杰酒 - 那当然了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And if there's any left, a '61 Bollinger. - Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.84,0:28:19.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点搞掂它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it... quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.44,0:28:22.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近忙不忙 邦德先生?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Been busy, have we, Mr. Bond?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.01,0:28:27.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忙着逃命啊 陈先生 日子不好混啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just surviving, Mr. Chang. Just surviving.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.27,0:28:50.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是安详欲望之泉的按摩师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Peaceful Fountains of Desire, the masseuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.04,0:28:53.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,经理特别关照过的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I come with compliments of the manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.04,0:28:56.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就知道...进来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure you do. Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.82,0:29:05.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请到床上去 脸朝下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the bed, please. Face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.06,0:29:10.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还象模象样的嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.40,0:29:16.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不是随随便便的按摩师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not that kind of masseuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.00,0:29:21.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不是随随便便的大嫖客!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not that kind of customer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.08,0:29:32.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为我不知道 你是中国的情报员吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think I haven't always known you're Chinese Intelligence, Chang?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.25,0:29:35.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 香港现在是我们的国土 - 别担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hong Kong is our turf now. - Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.82,0:29:38.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来这不是想要拿回它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not here to take it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.52,0:29:43.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手放下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put your hands down.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.03,0:29:45.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底要什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.86,0:29:48.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮忙你扳回一城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just to help you settle a score.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.53,0:29:51.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赵杀了你们3个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zao killed three of your men.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.27,0:29:56.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你安排我进入北韩 我帮你料理他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get me into North Korea, I'll take care of him for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.64,0:29:59.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又有什么好处?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's in it for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.88,0:30:02.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要报复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chance to get even.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.38,0:30:05.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先得从赵查起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zao has information I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.22,0:30:13.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我先得请示北京 - 去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll have to ask Beijing. - Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.62,0:30:15.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.12,0:30:19.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非你真的想留下来帮我按摩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless you really wanna give me a massage.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.48,0:30:36.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.15,0:30:41.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的一点心意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little thank-you from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.46,0:30:49.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古巴?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cuba?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.62,0:30:52.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来赵先生非常迷恋哈瓦那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seems Mr. Zao has lost himself in Havana.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.76,0:30:55.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你找到他 顺便帮我送送他(上西天)\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you find him, say goodbye from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.93,0:30:59.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很乐意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.80,0:31:05.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(哈瓦那)
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.17,0:31:35.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想拿些得雷他多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm here to pick up some Delectados.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.50,0:31:39.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得雷他多? 我们有30年没做这玩意了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Delectados? We haven't made Delectados in 30 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.77,0:31:43.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,环球出口 你们老板知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Universal Exports. Check with your boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.35,0:31:47.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Raoul...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.08,0:31:49.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,环球出口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Universal Exports.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.42,0:31:53.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.42,0:31:56.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您的护照\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your passport, se? Or.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.83,0:32:35.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为再不会有人抽得雷他多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd come to think the Delectados would never be smoked.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.40,0:32:40.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们对健康尤其有害 您是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are particularly hazardous for one's health, Mr...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.57,0:32:42.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.50,0:32:44.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.01,0:32:46.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道为什么吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.44,0:32:49.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它是维乐多烟草系列的副产品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the addition of the Volado tobacco.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.38,0:32:51.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,烧的很慢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slow burning.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.55,0:32:53.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,灭的也慢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It never goes out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.92,0:32:58.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像根废柴(无用的人)\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like a sleeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.59,0:33:01.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请恕我冒昧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry for the rude awakening.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.59,0:33:05.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱我的国家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love my country.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.39,0:33:08.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从没有要你背叛你的国家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd never ask you to betray your people.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.30,0:33:10.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我在跟一个北韩的 - 观光客?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm after a North Korean. - A tourist?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.87,0:33:11.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怖份子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A terrorist.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.13,0:33:15.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怖份子跟自由战士没有区别 各为其主罢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One man's terrorist is another man's freedom fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.47,0:33:18.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赵可不是什么善男信女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zao has no interest in other people's freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.15,0:33:29.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还有几个高层的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I still have some friends in high places.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.45,0:33:36.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该请的请了 该花的花了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Favors called in. Some dollars spread about.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.86,0:33:40.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们发现你的朋友在这里 在一个岛上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We find your friend is here, on an island.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.80,0:33:42.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在洛斯欧甘诺斯岛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In Los Organos.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.83,0:33:46.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那儿有个阿瓦瑞斯医生 经营了一所奇特的诊所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is a strange clinic run by Dr. Alvarez.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.00,0:33:49.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他研究基因治疗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He leads the field in gene therapy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.70,0:33:54.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来延长我们敬爱领袖的生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Increasing the life expectancy of our beloved leaders.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.78,0:33:57.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然还有富有的西方人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, of course, the richest Westerners.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.28,0:33:58.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(赏鸟地图索引 西印度群岛)
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.08,0:34:02.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们闹革命也许革掉了自由...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We may have lost our freedom in the revolution...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.75,0:34:05.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但却拥有了举世无双的医疗系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but we have a health system second to none.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.69,0:34:08.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好像革命后过得还不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't do too badly out of the revolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.52,0:34:11.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日子总得过下去啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We all have our ways of getting by.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.46,0:34:15.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不知道有多少政府官员...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd be surprised how many government officials come to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.93,0:34:19.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 为了回味过去糜烂的生活来找我 - 是啊...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...for reminders of the decadent times. - Yeah, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.80,0:34:22.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 借来用用好吗?  - 没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mind if I borrow these? - Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.10,0:34:26.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的线民告诉我 赵是个危险的人物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My sources tell me this Zao is very dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.27,0:34:28.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望我能给你更多的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish I could give you more help.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.35,0:34:33.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要一台好车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could use a fast car.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.76,0:35:16.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请给我一杯魔嘻朵酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mojito, por favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.32,0:35:19.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克鲁格先生 阿瓦瑞斯诊所的出入证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Krug, your admittance papers for the Alvarez Clinic.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.06,0:35:21.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也该是时候了 费达罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About bloody time, Fidel.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.93,0:35:24.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫多一点女孩到42号房去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Round up more girls and take them to room 42.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.14,0:35:30.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非你想成为太监\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless you want to be known as Fidel Castrato.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.73,0:36:37.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好壮丽的景色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Magnificent view.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.77,0:36:42.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可不是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.34,0:36:45.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真可惜其他人都没欣赏到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too bad it's lost on everybody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.04,0:36:47.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要喝魔嘻朵吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mojito?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.58,0:36:51.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,试试看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.52,0:36:57.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是珍安辛塔强生 朋友都叫我珍芮(白虎星)\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Giacinta Johnson. My friends call me Jinx.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.49,0:36:59.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朋友都叫我詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My friends call me James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.19,0:37:01.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说你叫珍芮(白虎星) ?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jinx, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.39,0:37:04.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,13号星期五出生的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Born on Friday the 13th.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.10,0:37:07.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你相信噩运吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you believe in bad luck?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.67,0:37:11.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说吧 我的感情关系似乎都不持久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's just say my relationships don't seem to last.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.50,0:37:13.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道这种感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know the feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.88,0:37:19.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,掠食者通常都在太阳西下时出现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The predators usually appear at sunset.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.98,0:37:21.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.18,0:37:24.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为此时他们的猎物出来喝酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's when their prey comes out to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.09,0:37:28.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喝的惯吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too strong for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.49,0:37:33.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以学着喜欢它 如果有时间的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could learn to like it. If I had the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.96,0:37:36.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有多少时间?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much time have you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.90,0:37:38.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到清晨为止 你呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until dawn. What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.20,0:37:40.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来这里赏鸟的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just here for the birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.34,0:37:44.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸟类学家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ornithologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.64,0:37:47.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 鸟类学家?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ornithologist, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.41,0:37:50.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真会说话咧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now there's a mouthful.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.58,0:37:56.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚要忙着找猫头鹰?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you're gonna be busy tonight with the owls then?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.12,0:38:02.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛斯欧甘诺斯岛没有猫头鹰 早上之前没有什么可以看的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No owls in Los Organos. Nothing to see till the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.42,0:38:05.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少外面没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not out there anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.29,0:38:11.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,掠食者...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what do predators do...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.56,0:38:14.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在太阳下山后做什么呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...when the sun goes down?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.80,0:38:17.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们大吃大喝...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They feast...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.77,0:38:21.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今朝有酒今朝醉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...like there's no tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.96,0:39:11.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一向都是这么好动的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you always this frisky?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.53,0:39:15.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那种要死要活的感觉 让人回味无穷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been missing the touch of a good woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.26,0:39:20.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁要死要活来着?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who says I'm good?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.54,0:40:34.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.84,0:40:37.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不需要轮椅 - 是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't need a wheelchair. - No?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.51,0:40:38.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在需要了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.63,0:40:57.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Se? Or.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.20,0:41:00.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好了 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay. - Gracias.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.30,0:41:06.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛斯欧甘诺斯岛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isla Los Organos
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.84,0:42:47.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要做染色体重置治疗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you are to have DNA-replacement therapy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.37,0:42:49.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我来解释这两个阶段\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me explain the two phases.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.81,0:42:54.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先 我们要杀死你的骨髓 清除染色体板块\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First, we kill off your bone marrow. Wipe the DNA slate clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.55,0:42:55.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二阶段:\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phase two:
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.08,0:42:59.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,引入由健康捐赠人身上 得来的新染色体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Introduction of new DNA harvested from healthy donors.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.22,0:43:00.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孤儿 逃亡者...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Orphans, runaways...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.02,0:43:03.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,流浪汉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...people that won't be missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.39,0:43:07.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得我是一位艺术家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like to think of myself as an artist.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.06,0:43:10.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是我创作的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this is when I create.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.60,0:43:15.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.94,0:43:19.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕这是一段痛苦的历程 不过...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is a painful process, I'm afraid, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.44,0:43:22.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,百炼始得金嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...all great art is.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.91,0:43:26.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很高兴能为你服务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll certainly enjoy working on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.72,0:43:32.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然 大部分艺术家...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, most artists are only truly appreciated...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.15,0:43:34.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都在他们死后才被尊敬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...after they're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.41,0:43:57.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我父亲是一位外科医师 我们住在新罕布夏州\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father was a sergeant. We lived in Hampshire.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.94,0:44:01.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我对乡间的生活有美好的回忆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have fond memories of the countryside.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.31,0:44:31.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(第一阶段完成)
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.34,0:44:32.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(第二阶段准备)
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.88,0:44:37.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(11号房)
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.21,0:45:04.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.18,0:45:06.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你总算注意到我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got your attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.11,0:45:12.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赵 你整容谁买的单?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's bankrolling your makeover, Zao?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.09,0:45:17.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是就那个在 北韩陷害我的那个人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Same person who set me up in North Korea?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.25,0:46:17.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,詹姆斯? 怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.91,0:46:21.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍芮 赶快离开这里!  快走! 快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jinx, you gotta get out of here now! Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.44,0:47:16.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.61,0:47:17.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.29,0:48:45.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看 这化学成份显示...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, my friend, the chemical composition shows...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.23,0:48:48.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是狮子山来的叛军钻石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...this is from Sierra Leone. Conflict diamonds.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.90,0:48:53.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这儿有个标记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's some kind of marking here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.17,0:48:56.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- "葛" - 我看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- "GG." - Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.74,0:49:02.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.28,0:49:06.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是冰岛的葛拉夫企业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From the Graves Corporation in Iceland.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.62,0:49:08.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是他的雷射签名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's his laser signature.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.69,0:49:12.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一位名叫古斯塔夫葛拉夫的人...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A man called Gustav Graves discovered diamonds there...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.42,0:49:15.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一年前在那儿发现了钻石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...a year or so ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.49,0:49:19.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但它们和叛军钻石完全一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yet they're identical to conflict diamonds.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.00,0:49:22.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是巧合啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What an amazing coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.33,0:49:27.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么能眼睁睁地看着他...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can he escape from a British warship...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.17,0:49:31.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从香港港口中央的 英国战舰上逃出来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in the middle of Hong Kong harbor, right under your nose?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.37,0:49:34.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 有趣的电台 蒙尼潘妮?  - 我听到有暴风雨要来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Interesting station, Moneypenny? - I got a storm warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.98,0:49:36.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你该把他牢牢看住的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were supposed to throw away the key...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.91,0:49:38.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而不是把大门打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...not leave the door wide open.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.11,0:49:41.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在暗示我和他的脱逃有关?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you implying I had a hand in his escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.92,0:49:44.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邦德腿跑的可真快 不是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Bond got away real fast, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.05,0:49:46.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他要遛的慢了就毕不了业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is what he's trained to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.12,0:49:48.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可他手底下可没闲着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your boy's been very busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.92,0:49:50.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在古巴烧了一家诊所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He torches a clinic in Cuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.49,0:49:54.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 他要是没有什么好家教...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, you put your house in order...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.53,0:49:57.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我不介意给他上堂课\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or we're gonna do it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.35,0:50:13.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先生 您的饮料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your drink, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.35,0:50:17.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸好我是点的是摇匀的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucky I asked for it shaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.73,0:50:27.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(古斯塔夫葛拉夫 钻石之王)
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.28,0:50:44.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他啥时候来?  - 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- When's he coming? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.68,0:50:51.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 看来他赶不上了 - 他正好赶上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Looks like your man won't make it. - He's right on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.76,0:51:28.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天可是你册封为爵士的大喜日子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wonderful day to become a knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.39,0:51:30.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你承认这份荣誉吗?  葛拉夫先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you be using your title, Mr. Graves?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.96,0:51:34.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老实不客气的讲:  我为我现在的身份骄傲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm proud of my adopted nation, but I'd never stand on ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.36,0:51:36.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别出心裁的进场仪式 你该不会奇怪...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After that entrance, you can't be surprised...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.73,0:51:39.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人家说你是爱出风头的"做秀客"吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you're called a self-publicizing adrenaline junkie, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.07,0:51:41.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我更希望我是个"冒险家"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I prefer "adventurer."
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.90,0:51:45.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们听说了伊卡鲁斯太空计划 到底是什么呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've heard about the Icarus space program. What's the secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.47,0:51:48.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是个惊喜 你们很快就会知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a surprise. You'll soon be enlightened.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.14,0:51:52.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你每天工作24小时 你不需要睡眠的说法是真的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You work 24l7. Is it true that you don't need sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.68,0:51:55.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人生苦短 干嘛浪费时间睡觉?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get one shot at life. Why waste it on sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.75,0:51:58.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您参加了奥林匹克剑术选拔?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aren't you trying out for the Olympic fencing team?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.65,0:52:01.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 听说您发狂般地练习 - 我一点都不粗鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We hear you're training furiously. - I never get furious.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.02,0:52:04.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像在击剑中所说的:"分数是什么(有什么用)? "\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As they say in fencing, "What's the point?"
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.63,0:52:05.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.93,0:52:09.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要让女皇等太久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't want to keep Her Majesty waiting any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.43,0:52:11.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 葛拉夫先生 - 葛拉夫先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mr. Graves. - Mr. Graves.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.68,0:52:27.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,命中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.69,0:52:32.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,命中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.12,0:52:36.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,命中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.66,0:52:42.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,维绿蒂?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Verity?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.63,0:52:44.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.13,0:52:46.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向您讨教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.44,0:52:52.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,花架子倒不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see you handle your weapon well.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.44,0:52:55.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,台上三分钟 台下三年功啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have been known to keep my tip up.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.98,0:53:01.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮个忙好吗?  来时没穿好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you mind? I think I've come undone.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.09,0:53:05.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乐意之至\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.86,0:53:10.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,命中 就位 开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hit. Positions. Play.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.03,0:53:15.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好瞧瞧我们这最棒的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feast your eyes on the finest blade in the club.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.30,0:53:17.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯塔夫葛拉夫?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gustav Graves?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.33,0:53:20.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的公关 米兰达佛洛斯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His publicist, Miranda Frost.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.64,0:53:28.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的得意门生 她很棒 对不?  My protégé.\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gorgeous, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.91,0:53:30.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在悉尼拿过金牌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She took the gold at Sydney.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.01,0:53:33.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是晋位的 如果没记错的话 - 晋位?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- By default, if I remember. - Default?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.98,0:53:37.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打败她的那个家伙 类固醇用药过量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The one who beat her OD'd on steroids.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.29,0:53:39.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米兰达的金牌当之无愧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miranda deserved that gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.45,0:53:41.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于是她现在教葛拉夫如何赢得金牌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now she's teaching Graves how to win one.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.92,0:53:44.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他只为利而战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He only plays for cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.86,0:53:48.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在这通杀四方 独孤求败\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's won so much, nobody else wants to fight him.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.77,0:53:54.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不要见个面?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna meet him?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.44,0:53:56.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.87,0:54:00.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,劳驾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lead on.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.41,0:54:05.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 葛拉夫?  - 维绿蒂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Gustav? - Verity.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.02,0:54:08.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 您是...  - 邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And Mr... - Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.42,0:54:11.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.56,0:54:17.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们见过吗?  - 如果有我会记得的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Have we met before? - I think I'd remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.29,0:54:22.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然 是我弄错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course you would. My mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.43,0:54:26.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 邦德先生 你赌不赌?  - 那得看赌什么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you a gambling man, Mr. Bond? - If the stakes are right.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.04,0:54:29.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一分一千元 会不会太多?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A thousand a point too much for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.84,0:54:34.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,维绿蒂 要下注吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Care to place a bet, Verity?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.55,0:54:39.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.68,0:54:41.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不喜欢看斗鸡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't like cockfights.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.78,0:54:44.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.15,0:54:47.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,失陪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.52,0:54:52.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三战两胜?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Best of three hits?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.09,0:54:55.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Positions.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.76,0:54:57.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备 开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready. Play.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.83,0:54:58.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}En garde.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.88,0:55:09.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,命中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.14,0:55:11.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Positions.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.61,0:55:13.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Play.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.22,0:55:21.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,命中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.99,0:55:23.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,2比0\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two-nil.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.86,0:55:25.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还要继续吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want to continue?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.56,0:55:29.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 要不要加注?  - 你有几个钱?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You wanna up the wager? - How much can you afford?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.93,0:55:33.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就赌这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's play for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.53,0:55:36.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在古巴拿到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I picked it up in Cuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.17,0:55:39.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信是你的物产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe it's one of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.61,0:55:44.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼哼 硬通货\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My, my. They do get around.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.34,0:55:48.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,钻石人人爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then diamonds are for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.78,0:55:53.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,精品之选 完美无瑕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brilliant specimen. Completely flawless.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.15,0:55:57.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就象非洲叛军钻石那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And chemically identical to African conflict diamonds.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.62,0:56:01.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会输的很惨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you're about to lose something very precious.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.23,0:56:05.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Positions.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.33,0:56:08.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.80,0:56:10.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 开始 - 小心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Play. - En garde.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.51,0:56:18.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.15,0:56:23.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还要来吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to continue?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.25,0:56:26.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天我不见红就不罢休!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course I want to bloody continue!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.32,0:56:28.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然我们已经加码...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But since we're upping the wager...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.72,0:56:30.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干脆就玩大点 你敢吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...let's up the weapons, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.79,0:56:37.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老规矩 谁见红谁就输\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's do this the old-fashioned way. First blood drawn from the torso.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.20,0:58:53.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,够了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.97,0:59:00.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米兰达 我们松松筋骨而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just a little sport, Miranda.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.24,0:59:08.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来还是你占了上风 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seems you beat me, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.48,0:59:14.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去楼下办手续吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Settle downstairs, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.67,0:59:32.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是个难得的对手 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a rare challenge, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.54,0:59:37.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个周末我在冰岛有个科技展 关于"伊卡鲁斯"的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm putting on a scientific demonstration in Iceland at the weekend. Icarus?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.81,0:59:41.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想必你有兴趣 米兰达 安排一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps you could join us. Miranda, make the arrangements.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.48,0:59:44.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先让我把这烂摊子收拾好再说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once I've smoothed things over with the club.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.58,0:59:47.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不敢想象没有你我该怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would I do without you?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.92,0:59:53.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说我们两个在冰岛会不会重逢呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I expect the pleasure of you in Iceland?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.59,0:59:56.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你死了这条心吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid you'll never have that pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.16,1:00:01.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邦德指挥官 有人让我把这个交给您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, Commander Bond. Someone left this for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.60,1:00:06.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是该重新装璜了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Place needed redecorating anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.85,1:00:55.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听说过这个地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard of this place.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.49,1:01:00.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从没想到有一天我也会在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never thought I'd find myself here.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.46,1:01:03.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有些事还是不知道的好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some things are best kept underground.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.23,1:01:08.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,废弃的车站 废弃的情报员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An abandoned station for abandoned agents.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.23,1:01:13.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你的请柬 - 你在葛拉夫身上查到什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Your calling card. - So, what have you got on Graves?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.14,1:01:16.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你陷我于不义...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You burn me...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.71,1:01:20.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 现在却要我帮你?  - 你想我道歉?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...and now you want my help? - Did you expect an apology?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.15,1:01:24.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你为求任务完成 会不惜一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you'll do whatever it takes to get the job done.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.92,1:01:27.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 就像你一样 - 不同的是 我不会妥协\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just like you. - The difference is, I won't compromise.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.12,1:01:32.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能要求我每样事情都做到黑白分明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I don't have the luxury of seeing things as black and white.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.79,1:01:36.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你走后 我们都变了 - 我没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- While you were away, the world changed. - Not for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.00,1:01:43.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在怀疑葛拉夫 不然你也不会叫我过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're suspicious of Graves, or I wouldn't be here right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.04,1:01:48.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你查到什么?  - 除了本他的自传外一无所知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So, what do you have? - Nothing beyond the official biography.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.97,1:01:51.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在钻石矿工作的孤儿...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Orphan working in a diamond mine...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.58,1:01:57.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主修工程 在冰岛找到钻石 把一半捐给慈善团体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...learns engineering, makes a huge find in Iceland and gives half of it to charity.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.52,1:02:00.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一夕之间 从一无所有到拥有一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From nothing to everything in no time at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.59,1:02:06.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 科技展是在是这个周末吗?  - 不过是他又一个炒作噱头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And his demonstration this weekend? - Probably just another publicity stunt.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.06,1:02:09.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我古巴诊所的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me what you know about this Cuban clinic.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.53,1:02:12.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,基因治疗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gene therapy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.36,1:02:16.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用染色体移植产生新的身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}New identities courtesy of DNA transplants.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.50,1:02:21.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所谓的"美容院"我倒是听说过 想不到是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So-called "beauty parlor." We'd heard rumors. I didn't think it really existed.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.07,1:02:24.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都不重要了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.34,1:02:30.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赵逃走了 不过他留下这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zao got away, but he left these behind.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.15,1:02:34.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全是葛拉夫矿里来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All from Gustav Graves' mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.52,1:02:40.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认为葛拉夫的矿只是个幌子 卖的全是非洲叛军钻石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's a front for laundering African conflict diamonds.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.93,1:02:45.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们查证要很小心 葛拉夫买通了很多官员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to tread carefully. Graves is politically connected.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.86,1:02:48.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,光脚的不怕穿鞋的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucky I'm on the outside, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.37,1:02:51.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来你又咸鱼翻生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seems you've become useful again.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.07,1:02:58.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是该恢复我的工作了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then maybe it's time you let me get on with my job.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.62,1:04:21.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请原谅我的坦白:  哪有打工的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forgive my mentioning it, but a perfect marksman...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.83,1:04:25.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把枪口对准老板的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...isn't really supposed to shoot his own boss.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.67,1:04:29.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以倒回去看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check the replay.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.70,1:04:34.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会发现他死了 而她只是一点皮外伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll find he's dead and she's only got a flesh wound.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.24,1:04:37.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你总有借口是不是 零零零?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's always an excuse, isn't there, double-O zero?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.08,1:04:40.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要不信我的枪法 我可以去靶场证明给你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me the old firing range any day.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.15,1:04:44.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可这不是靶场 你要适应新方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, but it's called the future, so get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.15,1:04:49.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这儿就是你们扔垃圾的地方?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So this is where they keep the old relics, then, eh?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.35,1:04:53.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这儿是我们开发尖端科技的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is where our most cutting-edge technology is developed.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.89,1:04:56.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 懂了 - 你非得这么好奇吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Point taken. - Must you touch everything?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.76,1:04:58.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个还能用吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does this still work?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.40,1:05:08.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 听着... - 尖端科技"尖"在哪儿?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now, look... - So where is this cutting-edge stuff?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.57,1:05:10.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我正要说到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying to get to it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.11,1:05:15.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把枪给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weapon, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.62,1:05:25.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一片安全玻璃 一只普通的戒指\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One pane unbreakable glass, one standard-issue ring finger.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.72,1:05:29.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,转一下...哇啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twist so. Voilo.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.56,1:05:33.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超高频单音振动器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ultra-high frequency single-digit sonic agitator unit.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.30,1:05:36.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你的聪明盖过了你的样貌 - 我比你想象中还要聪明...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're cleverer than you look. - Better than looking cleverer...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.77,1:05:38.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,包括你 跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...than you are. Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.67,1:05:42.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你的新表 我相信这是第20只了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, a new watch. This will be your 20th, I believe.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.44,1:05:44.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 时间过得真快 - 是啊 007...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How time flies. - Yes, well, 007...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.71,1:05:48.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过去的这么多年里 你从没还过我表\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...why don't you establish a record by returning this one.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.75,1:05:51.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的新座骑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your new transportation.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.49,1:06:06.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 也许你干活太累了 - 英国顶尖的工程科技\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maybe you've been down here too long. - The ultimate in British engineering.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.83,1:06:11.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你是在拿我开涮吧 - 我跟我的前任一样...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You must be joking. - As I learned from my predecessor...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.27,1:06:14.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,工作十分严谨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I never joke about my work.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.21,1:06:19.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奥斯顿马丁叫它"反窥视" 我们称它做"反凝视"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aston Martin call it the Vanquish, we call it the Vanish.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.85,1:06:26.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 很好 - 自适应伪装\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Very good. - Adaptive camouflage.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.35,1:06:29.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们用微型摄像机把周围的环境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tiny cameras project the image they see...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.45,1:06:33.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,投影到车身的发光聚合物表皮上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...onto a light-emitting polymer skin on the opposite side.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.36,1:06:37.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一般人不仔细看是看不出来的 再加上几个精心设计:\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the casual eye, as good as invisible. Plus, the usual refinements:
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.53,1:06:43.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弹射椅 鱼雷 自锁定机枪 可用以射击移动的目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ejector seat, torpedoes, target-seeking shotguns to shoot down mobile objects.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.40,1:06:48.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是说明书 顶多两个钟头你就能搞掂它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The manual. Should be able to shoot through that in a couple of hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.91,1:06:56.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Q 只要几秒钟就搞掂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just took a few seconds, Q.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.45,1:07:00.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我如果能让你也消失就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wish I could make you vanish.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.29,1:07:04.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.43,1:07:12.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你执意要去冰岛执行任务...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before you leave on your mission for Iceland...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.40,1:07:15.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我你是怎么看詹姆斯邦德的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...tell me what you know of James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.67,1:07:18.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是零零情报员 我今天才发现他是特狂野的那种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a double-O. A wild one, as I discovered today.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.47,1:07:22.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他喜欢火上浇油...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll light the fuse on any explosive situation...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.81,1:07:27.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,累己累人 草菅人命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and be a danger to himself and others. Kill first, ask questions later.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.65,1:07:32.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挑衅 好战 一个冷面杀手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His method is to provoke and confront. A man nobody can get close to.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.65,1:07:35.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个花花公子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A womanizer.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.02,1:07:39.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在冰岛跟他碰头的机会很多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to be seeing a lot more of him in Iceland.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.35,1:07:44.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很尊重您的意旨 但他可能会暴露我的身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With great respect, a man like him could blow my cover.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.43,1:07:50.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你自愿做这个案子 但三个月来几乎没什么成果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You volunteered for this, but in three months, you've found next to nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.86,1:07:52.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葛拉夫看来没什么问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Graves seems to be clean.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.96,1:07:57.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邦德不这么认为 所以我想让他象你所说的那样:\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bond thinks differently, so I'm going to let him do what you so ably described:
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.13,1:08:01.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去葛拉夫先生那里搅局 你在那里...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mix things up a little with Mr. Graves. With you there...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.87,1:08:04.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正好让事情不会失控\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...things won't get out of hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.17,1:08:09.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过去三年你做密码研究时 工作和私人生活分开得很清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In your three years in Cryptology, you've kept business and pleasure separate.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.94,1:08:16.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并没和任何同事发生纠葛 即使有好几次别人追求你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You haven't fraternized with any of your fellow agents, despite several advances.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.51,1:08:20.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和同一个圈子里的人交往 是非常不智的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would be foolish to get involved with someone within the community.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.02,1:08:23.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尤其是詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Especially James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.12,1:09:00.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是奇尔先生(音同杀)\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Mr. Kil.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.19,1:09:03.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是个死而无憾的好名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, there's a name to die for.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.26,1:09:35.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时速324里 新的个人最好纪录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three hundred and twenty-four miles an hour. A new personal best.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.46,1:09:38.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二推进器又坏了 修好它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thruster two cut out again. Get it fixed.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.03,1:09:43.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 很高兴你能来 羡慕我吗?  - 我羡慕你可以死的快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Glad you could make it. Like my run? - You were on the edge of losing control.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.20,1:09:48.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有在生与死的边缘我们才能 真正认清自己 褪下伪装\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's only by being on the edge that we know who we really are. Under the skin.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.84,1:09:54.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿唐诺坎贝尔1967年的"青鸟"为例 他创下了水上纪录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take your Donald Campbell. 1967, the Bluebird. Water speed record.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.91,1:10:00.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没到第二圈他就挂了 - 但他拼了命是在追寻自己的梦想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Campbell died on his return run. - But he died chasing a dream.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.32,1:10:03.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 人不也该这样的嘛?  - 死活我也不去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Isn't that the way to go? - I'd rather not go at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.89,1:10:08.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 追寻梦想不如创造梦想 - 不睡觉的好处之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You don't chase dreams, you live them. - A virtue of never sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.46,1:10:13.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是我必须创造我的梦想 再说 死后你想不睡都难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to live my dreams. Besides, plenty of time to sleep when you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.87,1:10:16.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.60,1:10:20.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 佛洛斯特小姐 - 我带您去您的房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Miss Frost. - I'll show you your room.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.81,1:10:23.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冰的殿堂 你有没有家的感觉?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A palace of ice. You must feel right at home.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.78,1:10:26.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是为了今晚的演示而建造的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was built for tonight's demonstration.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.61,1:10:29.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人们既能观赏到火爆的演出 同时也能感受到冰冷的舒适\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The human element necessitates a balance of heat and cold.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.18,1:10:33.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那为什么建在湖上?  希望葛拉夫选错址\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Built on a lake? Hope Graves got things right.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.25,1:10:36.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 隔壁是什么?  - 钻石矿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's that property next door? - The diamond mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.52,1:10:38.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和葛拉夫先生的住处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Gustav's living quarters.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.43,1:10:51.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.84,1:10:56.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.07,1:11:02.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 还有什么要交待的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wonderful. Would you like to show me more?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.86,1:11:20.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伏特加马丁尼 加多点冰 如果你不介意的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vodka martini. Plenty of ice, if you can spare it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.70,1:11:25.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔嘻朵?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mojito?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.27,1:11:31.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 来赏企鹅吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James. Here for the penguins this time?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.54,1:11:36.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 还是又来赏景的?  - 我只对濒临绝种的动物有兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Or for the view again? - I'm only interested in endangered species.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.98,1:11:38.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 包括我吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, does that include me?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.28,1:11:43.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那得看这次你又想干什么 - 上次我在危急关头舍你而去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Depends on what you're up to this time. - So I left you in an explosive situation.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.55,1:11:46.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是因为你这么本事肯定不用我照顾的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Figured you could handle yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.06,1:11:52.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 难怪你的感情关系都不持久 - 我只是不喜欢有人碍手碍脚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No wonder your relationships don't last. - I just don't like to get tied down.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.21,1:12:37.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看起来气色真差\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look terrible.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.48,1:12:42.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也好不到哪去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You aren't looking too good yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.28,1:12:53.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 还有副作用吗?  - 我老是睡不着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're still feeling the side effects? - The insomnia is permanent for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.32,1:12:56.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这玩意可让我短时间恢复精力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An hour on the Dream Machine keeps me sane.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.33,1:12:59.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么会这样?  - 邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What happened to you? - Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.33,1:13:03.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他什么都不知道 我和他距离这么近...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He knows nothing. I've been this close to him...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.30,1:13:05.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他却不知道我到底是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and he didn't know who I really was.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.57,1:13:12.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 在易容之后你见过我父亲?  - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You saw my father after your exchange? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.88,1:13:17.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 孟将军仍在哀悼你的不幸 - 我的不幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- General Moon still mourns your death. - My death.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.02,1:13:20.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.18,1:13:26.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你是...  - 史威夫 太空科技杂志社的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And Miss... - Swift. Space and Technology magazine.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.52,1:13:31.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗? 邦德先生有没有跟你吹 他的"大爆炸"理论?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really? I take it Mr. Bond's been explaining his big-bang theory?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.39,1:13:35.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 啊对 我想我已经被感动了 - 看出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, I think I got the thrust of it. - I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.56,1:13:41.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,演示会五分钟后就要开始了 走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The demonstration's about to begin in five minutes. Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.50,1:13:44.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.47,1:13:52.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么不是珍芮(白虎星)?  - 我什么时候都是你的白虎星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Not "Jinx" anymore? - I'll always be a jinx to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.65,1:14:05.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直都在努力 试着回报这片土地...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm always trying to give the planet something in return...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.79,1:14:07.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生我养我的土地:\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...for what it has given me:
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.93,1:14:11.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为赐给了我宝贵的钻石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those little shards of heaven known as diamonds.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.86,1:14:16.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,钻石不仅仅是块值钱的石头 它们是梦想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Diamonds aren't just expensive stones. They are the stuff of dreams.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.84,1:14:19.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了它就可梦想成真\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the means to make dreams real.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.96,1:14:43.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想像一下:  这个世界灿烂光明...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Imagine being able to bring light and warmth to the darkest parts of the world...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.93,1:14:47.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,百姓五谷丰登 人民丰衣足食\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...being able to grow crops year-round, bringing an end to hunger.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.07,1:14:51.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想像一下又一颗太阳...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Imagine a second sun...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.40,1:14:54.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如钻石一般闪耀在天空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...shining like a diamond in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.24,1:14:58.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,光芒四射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let there be light.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.82,1:15:08.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向您呈现伊卡鲁斯!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I give you Icarus!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.96,1:15:20.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡鲁斯的设计非常独特的  它的银色外皮能吸收太阳光...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Icarus is unique. Its miraculous silver skin will inhale the sun's light...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.67,1:15:23.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再慢慢的散发到地球表面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and breathe it gently upon the Earth's surface.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.44,1:15:28.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们想像不到伊卡鲁斯 将会如何改变你的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have no idea how much Icarus is about to change your world.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.25,1:15:45.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们用内心的狂热 去闪耀美丽的夜晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now let us brighten this night with our inner radiance.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.28,1:16:09.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 可以收工了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, that's a wrap.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.72,1:17:24.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 小毛 给我看看你改的怎么样了 - 是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Vlad, show me the modifications. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.86,1:17:28.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你要我加进去的自卫装置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here is the self-defense mechanism you asked me to build in.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.86,1:17:31.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 5万伏特?  - 十万\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fifty-thousand volts? - A hundred.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.43,1:17:36.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用起来...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Armed...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.80,1:17:40.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不是很危险?  - 非常危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...and very dangerous. - Very.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.06,1:17:59.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(高压回流阀 警告)
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.79,1:18:06.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(进汽阀未关闭前 请勿关闭)
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.45,1:18:21.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(入侵警告)
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.20,1:18:39.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日防夜防 家贼难防\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}M warned me this would happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.83,1:18:42.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就知道是M在背后搞鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why you tried not to be interested in me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.63,1:18:45.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老天 你比传说中还更衰格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, you're even worse than your file says.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.97,1:18:50.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做戏就要做全套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They don't look too convinced.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.24,1:18:52.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油 更要毫无保留\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, put your back into it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.15,1:19:03.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有什么花花肠子我一清二楚 你一点安全感都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know all about you. Sex for dinner, death for breakfast. Not gonna work with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.79,1:19:05.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没有?  - 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.17,1:19:17.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 可是你现在很享受嗳 - 住口 你想吃豆腐吃到什么时候?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're getting good at this. - Stop it. Are we still being watched?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.20,1:19:21.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他们老早就走开了 - 老天 真受不了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They left ages ago. - God, you're impossible.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.84,1:19:23.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.44,1:19:56.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你既然对我这么有兴趣 干脆留下来好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd better stay here. Keep up the charade of being lovers.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.24,1:19:57.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.64,1:20:02.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你那毛糙的性格有进步嘛  足足两小时过后你才开始捣乱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I admire your restraint. You were here a full two hours before anything blew up.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.35,1:20:07.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你再这样下去我们两个迟早得完蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The way you're going, you'll get us both killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.99,1:20:14.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 告诉你在北韩怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James, tell me what really happened in North Korea.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.36,1:20:16.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我被出卖了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was betrayed.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.53,1:20:18.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was all.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.47,1:20:24.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是江湖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Occupational hazard.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.48,1:20:34.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天 枉你还是零零情报员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is crazy. You're a double-O.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.58,1:20:36.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那都素些浮云\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's only a number.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.56,1:21:15.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,詹姆斯...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.79,1:21:20.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...be careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.10,1:21:26.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回到你房间 我会回来找你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go back to your room. I'll come back for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.40,1:22:00.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么要"杀"我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you want to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.10,1:22:04.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准确的说是"人道毁灭"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought it was the humane thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.64,1:22:10.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁派你来的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who sent you?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.25,1:22:14.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mama.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.48,1:22:16.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她要我转达她对你是多么的失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And she's really disappointed in you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.45,1:22:22.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就告诉你吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll let you in on a little secret.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.62,1:22:26.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个矿是蒙人的 但这个镭射刀...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This mine is fake, but the lasers...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.06,1:22:29.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却是杀人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...are real.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.65,1:22:52.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她不肯说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She won't talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.49,1:22:55.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那她以后也不用说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's make it permanent.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.49,1:22:57.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我习惯用刀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll use the laser.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.59,1:22:59.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手脚干净点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't leave a mess.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.04,1:24:19.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 珍芮?  - 詹姆斯! 快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jinx? - James! James! No, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.47,1:24:21.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快关掉它!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn it off! Off! Off!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.77,1:24:51.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 打扰一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James, I could use a little help here.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.35,1:24:59.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快关掉它...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Switch it off...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.58,1:25:02.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然我就要被大卸八块了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or I'll be half the girl I used to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.26,1:25:47.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得有人说我碍手碍脚来着?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, the girl who hates to be tied down, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.59,1:25:49.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要不要放我下来吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you gonna get me off this?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.53,1:25:52.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你哪格庙的 中情局?  - 国家安全局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you, CIA? - NSA.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.20,1:25:56.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们一条船上的 - 却是同船(床)异梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're on the same side. - Doesn't mean we're after the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.34,1:25:59.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,错 世界和平 爱满人间... 是我们共同的梦想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure it does. World peace, unconditional love...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.64,1:26:02.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然 还有这位 一脸富贵相的小"痘痘"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and our little friend with the expensive acne.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.18,1:26:05.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 赵?  - 对 是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Zao? - Yeah, Zao.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.98,1:26:09.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他回那边去了 还有那个诡异迷幻面具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's back there with some weird, psychedelic light mask.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.75,1:26:13.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是从古巴诊所带回来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably brought it from the clinic in Cuba.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.22,1:26:15.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能是他带回来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He couldn't have brought it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.89,1:26:17.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个东西本来就是这里的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was already here.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.96,1:26:23.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它属于另一个韩国人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It belongs to another Korean.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.00,1:26:25.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的上司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His boss.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.47,1:26:33.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们需要奇尔的指纹来开门 - 我有更好的主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We need Kil to help us get out of here. - I got a better idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.84,1:26:38.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(使用者代号)
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.01,1:26:40.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(身份无误)
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.08,1:26:46.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我要去寻求支援 - 等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm going to get backup. - Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.35,1:26:49.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先去找米兰达 她是MI 6号 叫她先离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to Miranda first. She's MI6. Warn her to get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.59,1:26:51.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你有什么打算?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.46,1:26:53.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还有事要做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unfinished business.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.51,1:27:09.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你苟延残喘就是为了挑个黄道吉日...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you live to die another day...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.84,1:27:11.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 上校?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...colonel.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.88,1:27:17.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 我还以为你做梦都想不到呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At last. I was beginning to think you'd never guess.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.95,1:27:19.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,痛不痛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was it painful?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.62,1:27:23.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 基因治疗?  - 你无法想像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The gene therapy? - You couldn't possibly imagine.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.66,1:27:26.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 这下我放心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. I'm glad to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.79,1:27:29.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃得苦中苦 方为人上人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there have been compensations.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.53,1:27:32.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把你当猴耍玩玩也不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like watching you flail around in your ignorance.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.63,1:27:35.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老鼠没有被玩够 猫咪是不急于吞下肚的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Granting you life just to see if you'd get wise.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.77,1:27:37.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我玩的挺开心的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.00,1:27:40.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思  快乐的时光总是那么短暂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the fun is about to come to a dead end.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.28,1:27:44.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你我打交道的时间不长...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We only met briefly, you and I...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.18,1:27:47.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却给我留下了难以磨灭的印象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but you left a lasting impression.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.95,1:27:51.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当我重获新生 重新做人的时候...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you forced me to present the world with a new face...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.99,1:27:56.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就刻意的在模仿你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I chose to model the disgusting Gustav Graves on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.56,1:28:00.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,详细点来说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just in the details.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.33,1:28:04.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是话中有话 模棱两可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That unjustifiable swagger.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.33,1:28:09.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫名其妙 胸无点墨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your crass quips, a defense mechanism concealing such inadequacy.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.47,1:28:12.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喝的墨水全灌这里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My defense mechanism is right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.51,1:28:20.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来 佛洛斯特小姐也不简单啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, Miss Frost is not all she seems.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.75,1:28:23.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要以貌取人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks can be deceptive.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.99,1:28:27.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.39,1:28:31.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道是谁在北韩出卖你吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you find out who betrayed you in North Korea?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.76,1:28:33.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迟早的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.33,1:28:37.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就没想过是内鬼所为?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never thought of looking inside your own organization?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.54,1:28:44.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,远在天边 近在眼前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was right under your nose.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.17,1:28:50.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,睡觉也带着枪是个好习惯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was so good of you to bring your gun to bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.28,1:28:54.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没办法 江湖险恶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Occupational hazard.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.72,1:29:00.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道 我有一种天赋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, I have a gift.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.55,1:29:03.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以察知别人弱点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An instinct for sensing people's weaknesses.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.55,1:29:07.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的弱点是"女人" 她和我的 弱点是"必胜"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yours is women. Hers and mine is winning, whatever the cost.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.59,1:29:11.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在悉尼我使计把她扶上金牌奖座...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I arranged for the fatal overdose of the true victor at Sydney...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.73,1:29:15.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在她则成了我专用的 MI 6号情报员...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I won myself my very own MI6 agent...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.00,1:29:21.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想怎么用就怎么用:  她的智慧 她的天才...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...using everything at my disposal: her brains, her talent...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.14,1:29:24.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至是她的肉体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...even her sex.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.51,1:29:26.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女人的致命武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The coldest weapon of all.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.61,1:29:31.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈啰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.35,1:29:33.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米兰达?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miranda?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.76,1:29:42.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀了我一个 还有后来人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There will be others after me.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.96,1:29:45.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说你的美国朋友 珍芮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean your American friend, Jinx.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.70,1:29:51.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又一个无辜者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soon to be the victim of a tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.30,1:29:56.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这儿看似宫殿其实却是地狱 - 除下你的设备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- An ice palace can be a treacherous place. - Hand over the toys.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.77,1:29:58.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行 没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.38,1:30:05.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道吗 我爱死你的"大麻子"了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I've missed your sparkling personality.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.95,1:30:08.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,临死还嘴硬?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's that for a punch line?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.85,1:30:10.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.49,1:30:13.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邦 昨晚真是棒...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I enjoyed last night, James...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.49,1:30:14.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过你真的没有安全感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but it really is death for breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.21,1:30:33.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀了他 不要声张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill him, quietly.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.44,1:31:09.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快动手!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill him. Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.12,1:31:21.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他逃掉了 - 没有关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He got away. - No matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.29,1:31:23.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫嬉老鼠乐趣多多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pleasure of the kill is in the chase.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.33,1:31:25.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请将军过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring me the generals.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.37,1:31:38.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诸位...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.81,1:31:40.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我答应会演示给你们看的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I promised you a demonstration.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.54,1:31:44.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在你将要看到 伊卡鲁斯真正的威力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you will see the true power of Icarus.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.05,1:31:56.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西方间谍逃得了一时 但他躲不过一世\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Western spy runs, but he cannot hide.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.90,1:32:11.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡鲁斯能锁住发热方位 然后聚焦太阳能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Icarus will lock on to the heat signature and concentrate the sun's power.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.79,1:32:32.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老板 他破了你的记录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, boss, he beat your time.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.66,1:33:40.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要切下这一整块\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to draw the line.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.23,1:34:13.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全球变暖真的很可怕的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Global warming is a terrible thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.69,1:35:16.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好身手 和邦德一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, nice moves, just like Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.22,1:35:20.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他昨晚也是一样强劲有力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was pretty vigorous last night as well.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.49,1:35:21.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他上了你?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He did you?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.16,1:35:25.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 想不到他会饥不择食 - 他不会看上你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I didn't know he was that desperate. - He's not coming for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.63,1:35:28.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他现在跑的比谁都快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He just died running, trying to save his own skin.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.74,1:35:32.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好料子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's pretty good tailoring.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.84,1:35:36.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望湿了以后不会缩水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope it doesn't shrink when it gets wet.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.61,1:36:09.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们很快就会成功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soon, we will be victorious.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.35,1:36:23.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一小时后动身 快去做准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got one hour to wrap this up. Let's move.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.85,1:37:25.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍芮 你在那里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Jinx, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.33,1:37:35.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有单位向我报告!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All units report. Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.22,1:38:00.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警告 自适应伪装失败\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Warning, adaptive camouflage failure.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.03,1:39:57.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是时候给美国人洗澡了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to give the American her bath.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.17,1:42:16.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顺应伪装修复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adaptive camouflage restored.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.06,1:43:08.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小毛 什么叫"人体工程学"?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vlad, does the word "ergonomics" mean anything to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.36,1:43:10.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以人为本? 还是机器为本?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man? Machine?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.73,1:43:13.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么看都象个手提箱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is still a suitcase.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.80,1:43:16.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我造个相衬的外形\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finish it, will you?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.16,1:44:27.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点 这里很暖的 快呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, it's warm in here. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.36,1:44:32.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,低温可以保持生命 对不对?  快点给我醒过来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cold kept you alive, huh? It must've kept you alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.70,1:44:34.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.17,1:44:45.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么这么久才来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What took you so long?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.58,1:44:46.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.99,1:45:04.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(南韩 非军事区域 美国指挥部)
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.24,1:45:21.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰探员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Agent Johnson.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.95,1:45:24.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 詹姆斯 - 查尔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- James. - Charles.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.65,1:45:28.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 我们长话短说 直奔主题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, bring us up to speed on this.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.59,1:45:33.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非军事区域北面有另一个部队集结 已经有8万人并在增加中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another division mobilized north of the DMZ. 80,000 troops and counting.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.56,1:45:37.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 另有一百万军力储备 - 孟的父亲不主张打仗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And another million in reserve. - Moon's father won't allow a war.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.89,1:45:39.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孟将军被捕了 强硬派是主谋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General Moon's under arrest. Hard-liners staged a coup.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.36,1:45:45.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你故意陷邦德入罪来误导我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You deliberately misled me by implicating Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.30,1:45:48.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 如果你早告诉我你的情报员... - 她早就死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- If you'd told us about your agent... - She'd be dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.84,1:45:51.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你的地下组织已经证实了 - 我们哪有什么地下组织...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Your mole would've made sure. - We wouldn't have a mole...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.17,1:45:57.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你早告诉我们佛洛斯特 和孟都在哈佛的剑术队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...if you'd told us that Frost and Moon were on the Harvard fencing team together.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.48,1:46:00.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们这行最重要的是知道要信任谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Knowing who to trust is everything in this business.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.92,1:46:03.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊 詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, well, James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.38,1:46:06.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 正赶上看烟火表演 - 严肃点 谈正事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just in time for the fireworks. - Let's get down to business.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.29,1:46:08.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在二区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're at DEFCON 2.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.96,1:46:12.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果北韩南进 他们会大举入侵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if the North goes south, they're gonna go south big-time.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.96,1:46:15.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是中间有个雷区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't just stroll through a minefield.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.36,1:46:19.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会另辟蹊径\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need some kind of an edge.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:19.30,1:46:21.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 伊卡鲁斯 - 我们已经注意到了...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Icarus. - We're taking care of that...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.67,1:46:24.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反卫星武器会在一小时内发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with an ASAT launch in one hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.67,1:46:28.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 葛拉夫在那里?  - 在北韩的一个空军基地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's Graves? - In a North Korean air base.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.21,1:46:31.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们现在对他无可奈何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're right where we can't touch him.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:34.18,1:46:35.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是你...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:36.58,1:46:38.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不包括我 - 听着...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...but I can. - Look...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:38.79,1:46:43.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在这里预防事情发生 不是来确定事情发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we're here in case things escalate, not to make sure that they do.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.22,1:46:46.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能入侵北韩 总统直接指示我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No incursions into the North. President gave me a direct order.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.33,1:46:49.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别拿根鸡毛当令箭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when did that ever stop you?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:49.96,1:46:52.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你爱去不去拉倒 我会派007去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You make your own decision. I'm sending in 007.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.80,1:46:57.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我这张老脸往哪搁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think I'd leave this in the hands of the British?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.71,1:47:00.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和他一起去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You go with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.94,1:47:03.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接近降落地带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Approaching drop zone.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:09.02,1:47:10.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 走了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.56,1:47:25.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他们已经进入北韩空域 - 别担心 罗宝逊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They've entered North Korean airspace. - Relax, Robinson.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.20,1:47:31.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的雷达看不到的话 北韩人更看不到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If our radar can't see those switchblades, the North Koreans sure as hell can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:46.69,1:47:51.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(北韩 平壤空军基地)
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.83,1:47:54.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老板 他们向伊卡鲁斯射击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, boss, they launched against Icarus.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.70,1:47:56.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开启自动模式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave it on automatic.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.74,1:48:12.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听说过高射炮打蚊子  可没见过发射火箭去打镜子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope nobody here is superstitious. That's one big mirror we're about to break.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.06,1:48:23.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.46,1:48:27.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,集结南韩部队 替我接总统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mobilize the South Korean troops. And get me the president, now!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:27.66,1:48:29.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没有邦德的消息?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still no news of Bond?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:43.61,1:48:45.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有车过来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vehicles.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.68,1:48:47.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有一些大人物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some big shots.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.62,1:48:53.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's him.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.32,1:48:59.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 300米 - 偏差 1.5\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Three hundred meters. - Windage, one and a half.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.43,1:49:09.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须登上那台飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta get on that plane.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.84,1:49:53.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你 请我父亲下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, have my father brought down.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.56,1:50:43.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.90,1:50:48.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很抱歉我们以这样的方式见面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I regret our meeting had to be like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.17,1:50:53.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认不出是我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't tell it's me?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:53.51,1:50:55.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不认识你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know you.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.21,1:51:00.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一直很难接受我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've always found it difficult to accept me.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:00.61,1:51:04.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样可能让你更容易忘却...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That made my exile easier to bear...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.28,1:51:06.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我从没忘记你教过我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but I never forgot what you taught me.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.89,1:51:11.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战争讲究谋略\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In war, the victorious strategist only seeks battle...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.52,1:51:14.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后才是战备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...after the victory has been won.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:15.96,1:51:20.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看 爸爸 我的功课没落下...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, Father, I remember my Art of War...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.60,1:51:24.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是致胜的法宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and this is what guarantees that victory.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:06.78,1:52:08.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,儿子啊...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My son...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.42,1:52:13.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have you done to yourself?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:14.52,1:52:15.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come, Father.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.42,1:52:20.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看你儿子多了不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch the rising of your son.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:49.25,1:52:51.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他要是敢动三八线...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The second that hits the 38th parallel...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:51.69,1:52:53.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老子就跟他玩命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...hit them with everything we got.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.93,1:52:56.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你玩他不过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That may not be enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:10.98,1:53:13.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到了吗 爸爸?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you see, Father?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.94,1:53:15.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡鲁斯还可以扫雷...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Icarus is clearing the minefield...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:15.95,1:53:18.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从此我们踏上了康庄大道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...creating a highway for our troops.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.22,1:53:23.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美国佬再不滚蛋 就等着收尸吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the Americans don't run, Icarus will destroy them.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:47.31,1:53:51.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日本鬼子我把它当球玩...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Japan is a bug waiting to be squashed...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.32,1:53:54.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西方世界就等着尿裤子吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and the West will shake with fear.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:58.32,1:54:00.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但美国人会发射核弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the Americans will send nuclear warheads.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:00.79,1:54:03.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡鲁斯会给它们迎头痛击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Icarus will swat them from the sky.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:48.27,1:54:51.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会害死我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will destroy us.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:56.68,1:54:58.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会杀你亲生儿子?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You would kill your own son?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.68,1:55:01.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的乖儿子早就死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The son I knew died long ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:19.47,1:55:23.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸...你让我失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father... you disappoint me.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:16.56,1:56:18.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警告 警告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caution. Caution.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:18.93,1:56:19.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 手动驾驶 - 爬高!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Manual. - Up!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:20.10,1:56:22.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手动驾驶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Manual.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:27.47,1:56:28.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 给我起来!  - 警告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Up! Up! - Caution.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:29.27,1:56:31.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 手动驾驶 - 求你了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Manual. - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:51.13,1:56:53.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:53.43,1:56:55.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:58.64,1:57:00.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞掂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:00.34,1:57:05.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啧啧 找你还真不容易 把枪拿出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My, my. You get around. Let's see your gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:06.28,1:57:08.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用左手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Left hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:09.38,1:57:11.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:12.15,1:57:13.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:13.55,1:57:15.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丢下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now drop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:16.82,1:57:20.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已经是众叛亲离了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like your friends have bailed.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:27.80,1:57:30.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打开自动驾驶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Push on autopilot.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:30.37,1:57:31.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:32.14,1:57:34.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这样 小朋友乖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it. Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:55.66,1:57:57.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 水性不错嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, drowning you didn't seem to work.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:58.06,1:58:00.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来我得费点功夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll have to try something more to the point.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:04.30,1:58:06.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有1000米远 越来越近了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One thousand meters and closing.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:53.58,1:58:54.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(战争的艺术)
Dialogue: 0,2:00:10.49,2:00:13.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这是班门弄斧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can read your every move.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:17.13,2:00:19.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看刀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Read this.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:19.70,2:00:21.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,婊子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bitch.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:57.14,2:01:01.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看 我们的降落伞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, parachutes for the both of us.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:04.01,2:01:06.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的降落伞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:11.72,2:01:15.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要知道 邦德先生 你玩不死我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, Mr. Bond, you can't kill my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:18.16,2:01:21.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就玩死你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But my dreams can kill you.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:22.03,2:01:24.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,面对命运吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to face destiny.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:40.41,2:01:43.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,面对地心引力吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to face gravity.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:23.16,2:02:25.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想我伤透了她的心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I broke her heart.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:28.86,2:02:31.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来我们要结伴去天堂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like we're going down together.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:32.80,2:02:33.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没那么快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:37.74,2:02:40.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 打开后舱门 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get the back open. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:57.72,2:02:59.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:09.26,2:04:11.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快 - 我说了我是剋夫的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on. - I told you I was a jinx.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:12.30,2:04:14.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should have warned you...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:14.27,2:04:16.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家彼此彼此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...my relationships don't last either.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:22.04,2:04:24.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少我们有个风光大葬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least we're gonna die rich.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:28.31,2:04:31.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快 快 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Come on, come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:31.88,2:04:33.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:53.17,2:04:55.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:55.34,2:04:59.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还想去天堂吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you said something about going down together?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:18.93,2:05:20.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(机密档案 米兰达弗洛斯特)
Dialogue: 0,2:05:21.20,2:05:23.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(销案)
Dialogue: 0,2:05:38.58,2:05:40.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:40.68,2:05:42.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蒙尼潘妮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moneypenny.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:26.93,2:06:29.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢 詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, James.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:39.08,2:06:41.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蒙尼潘妮?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moneypenny?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:43.25,2:06:47.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在测试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was just testing it out.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:48.78,2:06:50.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"硬"件还不完善 是不是?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's rather hard, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:51.02,2:06:54.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 "硬"就一个字!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Very.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:29.06,2:07:32.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要 不要拿出来嘛 我还没玩够呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, don't pull it out. I'm not finished with it yet.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:32.29,2:07:36.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧? 大小正好合适\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See? It's a perfect fit.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:37.33,2:07:40.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 留在里面 - 早晚都要出来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Leave it in. - It's gotta come out sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:40.77,2:07:45.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要 留在里面 求你了 再多几分钟好不好?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, leave it in, please. Few more minutes?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:47.61,2:07:50.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国有财产要缴公\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We really have to get these back.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:51.25,2:07:53.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,学雷锋拾金不昧 啊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still the good guys, huh?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:57.89,2:08:02.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你告诉雷锋叔叔你乖不乖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm still not quite sure how good you are.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:05.16,2:08:07.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会象兔子一样乖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am so good.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:09.80,2:08:13.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看你象只发情的母猫一样骚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Especially when you're bad.
